msgid "intro/cards/description/c_1"
msgstr ""
"When you purchase bonds during the {{eventName}}, you will receive a reward "
"from one of the unopened cells as a bonus gift. Cells contain valuable in-"
"game items, including the event's main reward: a Premium vehicle."

msgid "intro/cards/description/c_2"
msgstr ""
"Rewards are granted in random order. Each unopened cell has its own "
"probability of being selected, and all probabilities always total 100%. Once"
" a cell is opened, it cannot be opened again, and the chances of receiving "
"the remaining rewards increase."

msgid "intro/cards/description/c_3"
msgstr ""
"Each step costs a set amount of gold. Both the number of bonds received and "
"the step price vary as you progress."

msgid "intro/cards/link"
msgstr "View the conditions and prices for each step on the portal."

